<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates rise to 28pct in tight mkt.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates rise to 28pct in tight mkt.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates rose a full percentage point on Tuesday as market players sought to fill reserves ahead of Wednesday's deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Wednesday will be the day for (reserves) fine-tuning and it is difficult to predict movements,&quot; said Zoltan Szaloky of ABN-AMRO.</p>
<p>Overnight rates were quoted between 27.75 to 28.25 percent and finished at 28 percent compared with Monday's close of 27 percent.</p>
<p>-- Denes Albert, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
